  answers:
  - question: "Deprem s\u0131ras\u0131nda s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 terk ederken ne yapmal\u0131s\u0131n?"
    answers:
    - "Panik yapmadan s\u0131ran\u0131z\u0131 koruyarak bah\xE7eye \xE7\u0131kmak"
    - "H\u0131zl\u0131ca ko\u015Farak \xE7\u0131kmak"
    correctAnswerId: 0
  - question: "\xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F s\u0131ras\u0131nda kime dikkat etmelisin?"
    answers:
    - Kimseye dikkat etmene gerek yok
    - "Arkada\u015Flar\u0131na ve \xF6gretmenine"
    correctAnswerId: 1
  - question: "Bah\xE7eye \xE7\u0131karken neyi unutmamal\u0131s\u0131n? "
    answers:
    - "Sakin ve d\xFCzenli olmay\u0131"
    - "E\u015Fyalar\u0131n\u0131 toplamay\u0131"
    correctAnswerId: 0
  - question: "S\u0131n\u0131fta hangi e\u015Fyalar\u0131 yan\u0131na almal\u0131s\u0131n? "
    answers:
    - "Kitaplar\u0131 ve \xE7antalar\u0131"
    - "Sadece mont ve yagmurluk gibi \u015Feyleri"
    correctAnswerId: 1
  - question: "Toplanma alan\u0131n\u0131z neresi?"
    answers:
    - "Okulun bah\xE7esi"
    - "S\u0131n\u0131f\u0131n d\u0131\u015F\u0131"
    correctAnswerId: 0
